  description: A wizard who belongs to wizard's guild called Fairy Tail. Lucy Heartfilia
    always seems to be manipulated by Natsu, but she's no fool. A celestial wizard
    capable of summoning spirits by opening otherworldly gates, her dream is to write
    a book about her adventures in the guild.
  summonDesc: All I want is a family who loves me for who I am, and I found that
    in Fairy Tail!
  fusionDesc: I'll never lose to someone who doesn't understand how to protect his
    own allies!
